// Title: Suspicious Cabinet File Execution Via Msdt.EXE
// Rule ID: dc4576d4-7467-424f-9eee-fd2b02855fe0
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1202
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_msdt_susp_cab_options.yml
//
